title: "My AI project in 7 phases: a practical simulation kit for generative AI"
abstract: "One conversation with an AI assistant takes a workplace initiative from first idea to dissemination, in seven phases. Each phase has a technique, a prompt to fill in, an iteration and a checklist. A teaching resource of the Ciência e Letras generative AI courses."
